  "historyNote": "#2557, eff 12-27-83; ss by #4730, eff 1-15-90; ss by #4898, eff 8-13-90; EXPIRED: 8-13-96 New. #6327, INTERIM, eff 8-24-96, EXPIRED: 12-22-96 New. #6449, eff 1-29-97; ss by #7307, eff 6-13-00; ss by #9179, eff 6-13-08; ss by #12083, eff 3-1-17 (See Revision Notes at Chapter headings for We 300 and We 600)",
